/-!
# A searched exact-automorphism class on `Fin 8`: data

The group is `24` permutations of `Fin 8`, the excess permutations that pin it from above are `2`,
and the invariant family it acts on has `256` members. How many of those have this group as their
automorphism group *exactly* is not computed and does not need to be: the family is indexed by the
subtype `Magma.tup8R75` of transport tuples passing `Magma.tupOK`, and both sides of the rectangle
